bove Combo:</strong> the rewards start to loop! Never stop eating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669720/extras/e7c94239625e99ba044bafd8be4e584a.poster.avif?t=1751578897\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669720/extras/e7c94239625e99ba044bafd8be4e584a.webm?t=1751578897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669720/extras/e7c94239625e99ba044bafd8be4e584a.mp4?t=1751578897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Game Modes, Multiple Levels:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature 3 main modes of play across multiple levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge mode:</strong>\u00a0Face off against hand-crafted sets of enemy waves uniquely designed for each level. Can you get the high score on each level?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless mode:</strong> Survive as long you can against endless procedurally-generated waves of enemies that get increasingly harder each wave. How many waves can you beat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack mode:</strong> Similar to endless mode but with extra time pressure: The clock is always ticking down and once it hits zero, your run is over. But you can add on extra time by scoring big combos and picking up bonus time drops in between waves. How long can you last?\u00a0</p>",
